<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola rated hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola rated hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it &quot;formalized&quot; its rating on Motorola Inc as a hold. The stock was previously not rated.</p>
<p>-- Natwest said it expects the first half of 1997 will be &quot;somewhat of a recovery period&quot; at Motorola.</p>
<p>-- It set a 1997 earnings estimate of $2.53 a share, and 1998 earnings view at $3.37 a share.</p>
<p>-- Motorola lost 3/8 to 66 a share in midday trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
